-04-07T00:00:00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 11, 2530, 1, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 2001, 'Freemium', 'zonajobs', 'zonajobs', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/2179005.html', '2026-04-12T07:05:36.461735');
